sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Discover matching accounts
    accDescr: Discovery crosses Browser Extension, Native Host and Desktop App boundaries. Integration opt-in permits matching account metadata without per-request approval; no plaintext password or TOTP seed is returned.
    box rgb(248,250,252) Browser Extension
        participant worker as Extension worker
    end
    box rgb(248,250,252) Native Host
        participant host as NativeHost
    end
    box rgb(248,250,252) Desktop App
        participant app as Desktop + Core
    end
    worker->>worker: Read current tab and origin
    worker->>host: Native Messaging: findCredentials(origin)
    host->>app: Named pipe: forward request
    app->>app: Check opt-in, unlocked state and origin
    alt Locked, disabled or invalid
        app-->>host: Deny
        host-->>worker: Deny
    else Allowed
        app->>app: Match saved origins in session metadata
        app-->>host: Metadata: IDs, names, usernames, flags
        host-->>worker: Metadata: matching accounts
        worker->>worker: Recheck tab and show accounts
    end
